Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.02,0:00:08.85,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.85,0:00:11.28,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Well, the one that always comes to pick you up is your dad, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.87,0:00:15.17,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi isn't my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.17,0:00:17.07,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Grandpa is my dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.33,0:00:19.71,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,That's weird!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:22.56,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Everyone has a mom and dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.91,0:00:25.76,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,So who's Daikichi anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.63,0:00:28.72,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.18,0:00:31.58,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, you're always saying strange things like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.94,0:00:32.30,Usaghi Main Top,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Men can't have babies, right? {Not sure if you want to move this line elsewhere to avoid having 3 lines. -mushu}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.58,0:00:32.30,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.30,0:00:35.24,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to have a dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.24,0:00:36.37,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.37,0:00:38.59,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Takes one to know one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.83,0:00:40.30,Usaghi Main Top,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Idiot! Idiot! Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.42,0:00:43.59,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Hiro-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.61,0:00:43.49,Usaghi Main Top,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.59,0:00:45.96,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun called me an idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:47.76,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,He said it over and over.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.76,0:00:49.65,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Hiro-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.52,0:00:54.99,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, do you live only with your mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.71,0:00:58.89,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,My dad went off somewhere, and they got a divorce later.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:00.45,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's a "divorce"?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:06.00,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,It means to stop being married.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.79,0:01:10.50,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if my mom's not around because she got a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.10,0:01:12.22,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,I wouldn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.64,0:01:15.94,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They'll get mad at you if you don't wear your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.21,0:01:19.18,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.49,0:01:22.54,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,The string is stretched out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.37,0:01:32.77,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan! Someone's here to pick you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.98,0:01:34.31,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.44,0:01:34.57,Usaghi Main Top,kid,0000,0000,0000,,It's Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.82,0:01:36.16,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,He's here to pick you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.15,0:01:37.96,Usaghi Main Top,toddler,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-tan, pick up!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.76,0:01:43.41,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Maa-kun, it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.24,0:01:55.08,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.29,0:01:57.00,Usaghi Main,teacher,0000,0000,0000,,See you later, Rin-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.00,0:01:58.63,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Goodbye!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.63,0:02:00.00,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What do you want for dinner?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.59,0:02:02.11,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.75,0:02:07.06,Usaghi Main,teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun! Your mom's here to pick you up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.13,0:03:49.13,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Your mom is really pretty!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.79,0:03:52.17,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,She's a noisy, old hag at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:56.44,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.44,0:03:59.82,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I hear Rin is always looking after Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.82,0:04:01.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I-Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.71,0:04:06.37,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,My son can be a little rude, so he has trouble making friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.61,0:04:08.35,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.35,0:04:11.56,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, not at all! I-In fact, I feel the same way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.89,0:04:14.06,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin isn't the friendly type either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.06,0:04:16.61,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess birds of a feather flock together.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.79,0:04:21.02,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! You were saying something about me, weren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.02,0:04:22.88,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It wasn't anything demeaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.88,0:04:24.50,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, keep walking!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:26.17,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't want to have to carry you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.17,0:04:27.41,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I won't ask you to!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.07,0:04:29.03,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.62,0:04:33.90,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Does Rin-chan prefer her dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.02,0:04:37.04,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not her father.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.04,0:04:39.23,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm something like a relative.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.23,0:04:41.26,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry! I just assumed...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.26,0:04:42.50,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Please, don't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.50,0:04:43.84,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Mom, you're slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.81,0:04:52.06,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm glad you made a friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.06,0:04:52.98,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.48,0:04:57.67,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun doesn't have a dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.01,0:05:01.32,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,He went away somewhere after getting a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.60,0:05:05.18,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, do you know what a divorce is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.18,0:05:08.07,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. It's when you stop being married, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.07,0:05:10.80,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.02,0:05:15.11,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,If God finds out, they'll be punished, won't they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.58,0:05:23.13,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder if my mom's not here because she got a divorce.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.55,0:05:28.34,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want to meet her?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.95,0:05:31.43,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.78,0:05:35.90,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.36,0:05:41.42,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.20,0:05:45.24,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,If she's like Kouki-kun's mom, I might want to meet her!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.98,0:05:47.36,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Me too! Me too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.84,0:05:55.12,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?! Rin-chan's mom is...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.14,0:06:01.03,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. Grandpa's maid is probably Rin's mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.03,0:06:02.08,Usaghi Main I,mom,0000,0000,0000,,That can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.70,0:06:05.84,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Do you know anything about the maid?
