Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.03,0:06:09.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A farewell party? For me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.83,0:06:11.67,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry it took so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.67,0:06:14.02,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,We've managed to settle down in time for winter orders. {TLC?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.02,0:06:15.12,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.12,0:06:17.41,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but I can't stay out too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.41,0:06:19.04,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My girl's only six years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.04,0:06:22.80,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Don't tell me you haven't been out drinking even once since then?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.80,0:06:25.23,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yeah. I shouldn't be doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.56,0:06:29.45,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't even care about drinking and stuff anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.45,0:06:30.50,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess I've aged.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.50,0:06:31.66,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,You're still only 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.99,0:06:34.40,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,And the workers in my department are pretty young,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.40,0:06:35.89,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but most of them have kids,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.89,0:06:37.70,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,so we don't really go out to drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.70,0:06:38.34,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.34,0:06:40.51,Usaghi Main,dude,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you got that right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.51,0:06:42.33,Usaghi Main,dude,0000,0000,0000,,I need to pick up my kid from nursery school.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.33,0:06:45.16,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,I have two kids, and the younger one is three months old.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.16,0:06:47.09,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,If I don't go home soon, my wife will...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.88,0:06:49.45,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,She's a scary wife, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.45,0:06:51.63,Usaghi Main,,0000,0000,0000,,It's really scary when she's angry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.90,0:06:57.18,Usaghi Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.84,0:06:58.93,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Gotou-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.93,0:07:01.57,Usaghi Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I heard about the farewell party.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.57,0:07:04.39,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but I can't go out at night, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.39,0:07:06.46,Usaghi Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,But they went to all that trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.46,0:07:08.01,Usaghi Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,How about bringing your kid along?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.01,0:07:09.69,Usaghi Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I'll bring mine too!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.97,0:07:12.43,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you trying to say that you want to go drinking—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.43,0:07:13.68,Usaghi Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,It'll be fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.51,0:07:16.38,Usaghi Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I'm looking forward to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.62,0:07:20.18,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.18,0:07:21.66,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, your phone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.95,0:07:24.15,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.15,0:07:25.07,Usaghi Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.07,0:07:30.99,Usaghi Main I,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi? It seems Grandpa hired the maid from an agency—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.99,0:07:32.69,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.92,0:07:34.55,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So, do you know her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.55,0:07:37.74,Usaghi Main I,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yoshii Masako-san, spelled with the kanji for "correct" and "child."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:42.27,Usaghi Main I,mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's the same way it's written on the mother-child health record, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.27,0:07:43.61,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.61,0:07:45.97,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Are you going to contact her?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.29,0:07:48.93,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,She went and abandoned such a cute kid—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.93,0:07:50.59,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Calm down!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.59,0:07:52.24,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You saw the mother-child health record, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.48,0:07:54.56,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There's so much written in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.56,0:07:57.18,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,and there's so much we still don't know!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:01.25,0:08:02.71,Usaghi Main Top,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 1,0:08:02.71,0:08:03.95,Usaghi Main Top,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Like I said...
Dialogue: 1,0:08:04.50,0:08:08.25,Usaghi Main Top,guy,0000,0000,0000,,I can't even tell the difference between home and work anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.86,0:08:08.25,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.53,0:08:11.97,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you're late! Here, have a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.17,0:08:12.48,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't come any closer, you drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.48,0:08:16.33,Usaghi Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan?! You really came!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.33,0:08:18.00,Usaghi Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.00,0:08:20.14,Usaghi Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, you're so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.42,0:08:26.94,Usaghi Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Eat as much as you want, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.27,0:08:28.61,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Here, have some.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.61,0:08:30.91,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Glad you could join us, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.91,0:08:31.99,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.58,0:08:35.53,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,Here, Rin-chan. Are you fine with orange juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.56,0:08:39.81,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan is such a beauty!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.81,0:08:40.79,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,She sure is!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.79,0:08:42.11,Usaghi Main,girl,0000,0000,0000,,She's blushing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.95,0:08:49.81,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yuu-kun, I'll scrape it together for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.81,0:08:52.06,Usaghi Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.65,0:08:56.61,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san, have some more!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.61,0:08:59.29,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin might fall asleep on the way home, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.12,0:09:02.77,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, I'm going to the lavatory for a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.77,0:09:04.25,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Just call it "toilet"!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.25,0:09:06.10,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:09.41,0:09:11.54,Usaghi Main Top,guy,0000,0000,0000,,He basically threw us away.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.54,0:09:14.97,Usaghi Main Top,guy,0000,0000,0000,,If you're going to bail, you're basically doing a half-assed job.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:14.97,0:09:16.67,Usaghi Main Top,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Quitting while at your best...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.67,0:09:18.95,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Sales are gonna be tough from this month on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.95,0:09:22.44,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Even if we manage to sell, management's going to compare sales to last year's.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.44,0:09:23.79,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,I wonder what we should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.72,0:09:26.16,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What can a guy do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.49,0:09:30.63,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The old me would've barged in and given them a piece of my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.53,0:09:32.37,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm gonna leak.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.45,0:09:35.72,Usaghi Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,Girls are so soft!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.05,0:09:38.85,Usaghi Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I want you as my kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.16,0:09:43.76,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,My priorities have changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:45.18,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.71,0:09:48.11,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,About your transfer...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.11,0:09:53.90,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,After seeing Rin-chan, I finally understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.59,0:09:57.32,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Right?
Dialogue: 1,0:09:57.65,0:09:59.58,Usaghi Main Top,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Mama! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.72,0:10:00.24,Usaghi Main,Gotou,0000,0000,0000,,I want to hold you forever!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:59.58,0:10:01.38,Usaghi Main Top,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Pick me up too!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.62,0:10:03.31,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Gotou-san, it looks like Rin-chan doesn't like it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.21,0:10:06.20,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Masako-san...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.83,0:10:11.00,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What did you think about your child... about Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.08,0:10:14.90,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yuu-kun was so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.90,0:10:17.55,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You sure like little kids, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.55,0:10:19.36,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. There was a letter in the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.80,0:10:20.43,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.50,0:10:26.14,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It says there will be a meeting about elementary school admission.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.14,0:10:28.81,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't done anything, and yet we get something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.63,0:10:30.44,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.00,0:10:35.23,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,There's going to be an admission test and stuff, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.53,0:10:36.75,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.75,0:10:39.33,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You can get in without any of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.33,0:10:40.17,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.17,0:10:41.48,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Really, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.48,0:10:44.17,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Compulsory education is awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:49.64,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Drunkard.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.73,0:10:52.92,Usaghi Main,kid,0000,0000,0000,,Dammit! How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.58,0:10:58.58,Usaghi Main,teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan, he's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.58,0:11:01.06,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,E-Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.90,0:11:04.49,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Jeez! Everyone else already left!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.59,0:11:06.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.08,0:11:09.80,Usaghi Main,teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki-kun, your mom's here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.73,0:11:12.69,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, Kouki.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.22,0:11:15.20,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,G-Good afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.45,0:11:17.68,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:21.15,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, are we going to make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.44,0:11:23.60,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll go call a taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.60,0:11:25.23,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.62,0:11:27.62,Copy of Sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8\fs20\pos(619,243)}Tasu Elementary
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.09,0:11:30.79,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Their ID cards will be turned around,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.79,0:11:34.93,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,so their names won't be visible on the way back from school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.93,0:11:38.80,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,Also, advise your child not to go to the park alone
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.80,0:11:41.77,Usaghi Main,guy,0000,0000,0000,,and not to go off with any person even if they know them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.56,0:11:43.76,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,This is hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.09,0:11:45.83,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Instead of teaching them to trust people,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.83,0:11:48.46,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,we have to teach them to be suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.46,0:11:49.84,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.60,0:11:53.62,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,About that sheet we were given earlier...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.62,0:11:54.17,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Whoops.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.17,0:11:55.23,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Let me carry them for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.91,0:11:59.58,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How do you know what vaccinations were given until now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.45,0:12:04.69,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.69,0:12:07.56,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Looks like I asked a weird question.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:08.59,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.59,0:12:11.12,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Do you have Rin-chan's maternity record book?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.93,0:12:13.39,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, it's at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.39,0:12:15.63,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,There's a page in there that lists vaccinations,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.17,0:12:17.34,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,so it's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.15,0:12:20.53,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.62,0:12:24.54,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I really don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.54,0:12:27.41,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I only met Rin three months ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.11,0:12:30.31,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Only three months?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.31,0:12:31.37,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.69,0:12:34.41,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}That's surprising.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.41,0:12:38.82,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I get the feeling that Rin-chan really trusts you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:41.35,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}You think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.35,0:12:45.18,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}At home, she's always talking back and won't keep quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.83,0:12:48.07,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}That's proof that she trusts you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.99,0:12:52.50,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,You seem like family, no matter how you look at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.31,0:12:54.55,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Family...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.84,0:12:58.13,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.48,0:12:59.54,Usaghi Main,mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, really!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.69,0:13:03.51,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so...?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.06,0:13:13.00,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.00,0:13:14.39,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I jumped over your shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.91,0:13:22.74,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not tired.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.74,0:13:23.44,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.03,0:13:27.32,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.65,0:13:29.05,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.05,0:13:31.05,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Put me down, I say!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.48,0:13:36.25,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.13,0:13:38.72,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We're pretty much done.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.13,0:13:41.55,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A school bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.55,0:13:42.17,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.39,0:13:43.67,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That's no good!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.67,0:13:46.75,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,The fashionable and brand name ones will be sold out soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.98,0:13:48.86,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A regular one is fine, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.86,0:13:51.10,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,That won't do for a girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.73,0:13:53.90,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Fine, I'll go this weekend.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.93,0:13:58.10,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Dai-chan, are you going to keep raising Rin-chan forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.05,0:14:02.66,Usaghi Main I,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,I heard you even transferred to another department.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.66,0:14:05.88,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't thought that far ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.88,0:14:06.57,Usaghi Main I,Reina,0000,0000,0000,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.28,0:14:09.41,Usaghi Main,,0000,0000,0000,,I'll do yours next!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.80,0:14:10.53,Usaghi Main,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.79,0:14:14.42,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You two sure get along well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.42,0:14:15.58,Usaghi Main I,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Well, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.58,0:14:18.83,Usaghi Main I,Haruko,0000,0000,0000,,Moms and daughters are like friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.74,0:14:29.24,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Mom and Kazumi get along well too, now that I think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.53,0:14:32.49,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's not certain that Masako-san's circumstances are the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.49,0:14:34.92,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,and maybe she wants to live with her daughter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.74,0:14:42.24,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's had so many!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.24,0:14:44.43,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Her mother must have—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:50.15,TS3,SIGNS (Banner),0000,0000,0000,,{\fscx133.75\fscy112.5\pos(188,183)}Souichi's Will
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:50.15,TS3,SIGNS (rabbit says),0000,0000,0000,,{\bord0\alpha&H75&\fscx76.25\fscy62.5\pos(329,146)}Da~pyon!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.45,0:14:51.35,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A will!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.88,0:14:53.16,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"Da~pyon"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.69,0:14:57.14,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"If Masako were to find this, she would probably get rid of it,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.14,0:15:01.62,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,so I've decided to do this the sifficult way.{typos in granpa's text replcated}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.26,0:15:05.45,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,However, I don't know how to write a secret code.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.45,0:15:09.46,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This ki-i-board thingy is making a fool out of me,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.46,0:15:12.18,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,so my proress is very slow."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.95,0:15:15.56,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There are so many mistakes in his typing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.28,0:15:19.15,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,"This old man's enery has already run out,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.15,0:15:20.93,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,hence, I'm giving up on blogging."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.93,0:15:22.54,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That was quick for a guy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.54,0:15:24.26,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,in the "generation with perspective"! {This line is too fast! Don't know how to change it! T_T -mushu}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.26,0:15:26.52,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,The continuation is in Rin's health record.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.17,0:15:33.53,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.53,0:15:34.78,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.94,0:15:41.52,Usaghi Main I,grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,I assume the person who finds this
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.52,0:15:45.19,Usaghi Main I,grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,really cares for Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.19,0:15:50.97,Usaghi Main I,grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Hence, I shall give an account of Rin and her mother, Masako.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.24,0:16:01.71,Usaghi Main I,grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,First of all, I would like to state that Masako is the type that is easily misunderstood
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.71,0:16:05.95,Usaghi Main I,grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,and is definitely not a bad person.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.95,0:16:09.79,Usaghi Main I,grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,She says that she's a failure as a mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.79,0:16:11.49,Usaghi Main I,grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,and that she feels sorry for Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.22,0:16:17.80,Usaghi Main I,grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,She still insists on keeping her position as my maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.02,0:16:20.50,Usaghi Main I,grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,It'll probably stay that way in the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.76,0:16:24.57,Usaghi Main I,grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,I believe that is the best for Rin's happiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:27.17,Usaghi Main I,grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Happiness? What does he mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.28,0:16:30.80,Usaghi Main I,grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Even if something should happen to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.80,0:16:34.79,Usaghi Main I,grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,to keep any of my relatives from finding out about her,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.79,0:16:39.14,Usaghi Main I,grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,she takes great pains to live a lifestyle that hides her existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.51,0:16:43.10,Usaghi Main I,grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,Masako truly loves Rin as her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.70,0:16:46.73,Usaghi Main I,grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,However, she is still young,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.73,0:16:51.17,Usaghi Main I,grandpa,0000,0000,0000,,so she might not have the maturity to act as a parent.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.53,0:16:55.44,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't get it,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.85,0:17:02.29,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but it looks like he truly cared about Rin and her mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.95,0:17:05.96,TS2,SIGNS,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(1,1500)\fscx111.25\fscy162.5\pos(251,191)\frz26.556}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.63,0:17:12.30,Sign,SIGNS (in cellphone),0000,0000,0000,,{\frz3.212\pos(350,196)\c&H817673&}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.59,0:17:14.91,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.33,0:17:17.86,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,W-What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.86,0:17:23.19,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, can you tie up my hair to make it look like rabbit ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.47,0:17:28.00,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Like Reina-chan's mom did once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.00,0:17:28.84,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.84,0:17:29.99,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.99,0:17:31.73,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Definitely impossible! It's too much to ask!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.11,0:17:36.26,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.65,0:17:37.68,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Because...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.44,0:17:40.81,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,They said I'm not cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.61,0:17:44.01,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did someone say that to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.78,0:17:48.50,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Mii-chan said I'm not cute at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.46,0:17:54.00,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I think Rin is definitely cuter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.74,0:17:57.22,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I want to be cute too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.96,0:18:00.39,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.79,0:18:07.83,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's already a young lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.83,0:18:10.07,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,so she can get her feelings hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.37,0:18:12.52,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Masako-san, did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.25,0:18:16.26,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin has already matured a lot mentally.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.78,0:18:20.01,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, there's still a side to her that hasn't matured at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.40,0:18:23.03,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So an adult has to keep an eye on her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.84,0:18:29.04,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.75,0:18:34.11,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This is...
Dialogue: 1,0:18:41.28,0:18:45.37,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,♪ Twinkle, twinkle, little star. ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.25,0:18:46.60,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Rin.
Dialogue: 1,0:18:45.37,0:18:47.85,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,♪ How I wonder what you— ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.60,0:18:47.85,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.73,0:18:51.35,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not supposed to tell anyone at home about Parents' Day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.49,0:18:53.91,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Parents' Day?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.91,0:18:55.23,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So you're not allowed to look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.43,0:18:59.73,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's gonna do it with that hairstyle?
Dialogue: 1,0:19:01.35,0:19:05.78,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,♪ Twinkle, twinkle, little star. ♪
Dialogue: 1,0:19:06.04,0:19:10.63,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,♪ How I wonder what you are. ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.04,0:19:08.00,Sign,SIGNS (cellphone),0000,0000,0000,,{\pos(348,207)\c&H817673&}Yoshii Masako
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.64,0:19:10.37,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you leave Rin alone thinking that
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.63,0:19:15.38,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,she'd get over it soon enough since she didn't like you to begin with? {TLC?}
Dialogue: 1,0:19:11.42,0:19:15.38,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,♪ Up above the world so high, ♪
Dialogue: 1,0:19:16.07,0:19:19.76,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,♪ like a diamond in the sky. ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.64,0:19:19.02,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If that's true, I'll hate you with a passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.11,0:19:23.12,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I hope you at least had a good reason.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:20.21,0:19:23.59,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,♪ Twinkle, twinkle, little star. ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.94,0:19:24.43,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But...
Dialogue: 1,0:19:24.43,0:19:28.70,Usaghi Main Top,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,♪ How I wonder what you are. ♪
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.70,0:19:32.35,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What reason could there be to abandon a child?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:35.86,TS1,SIGNS (top),0000,0000,0000,,{\frx344\fry340\frz349.289\fscx47.5\fscy51.25\pos(300,124)}Study desk $600
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.94,0:19:35.86,TS1,SIGNS (bottom),0000,0000,0000,,{\frz345.547\fscx35\fscy43.75\pos(353,274)}Study chair $130
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.27,0:19:35.85,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This one is cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.26,0:19:38.07,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's cute, all right,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.07,0:19:41.57,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,but you'll probably be using it for a while, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.94,0:19:43.33,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.33,0:19:45.37,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How about one that would suit a young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.18,0:19:47.48,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.27,0:19:52.07,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're right! Something that suits a young lady would be great!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.07,0:19:53.75,Usaghi Main I,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.36,0:19:56.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You want to sit there again?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.94,0:19:58.54,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do I look like a young lady?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.54,0:20:03.10,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, you could probably keep using this desk when you're in high school too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.10,0:20:04.64,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Does "high school" mean you're all grown up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.29,0:20:08.29,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I guess you'd be half an adult then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.49,0:20:13.97,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to read, so listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.53,0:20:19.75,Usaghi Main I,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A little girl went into a forest alone to play. {Story in italics? -mushu}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.31,0:20:26.25,Usaghi Main I,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,She got lost, and when she tried to find her way back,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.25,0:20:28.64,Usaghi Main I,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,she couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.44,0:20:34.58,Usaghi Main I,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Suddenly, she came across a small house in the forest.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.58,0:20:51.52,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is this Yoshii-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.69,0:20:53.94,Usaghi Main I,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.65,0:22:26.44,Sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\frz13.687\pos(352,194)}$4
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.96,0:22:28.61,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This one's cute, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.25,0:22:30.57,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Again? Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.47,0:22:32.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.18,0:22:34.04,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.99,0:22:37.24,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.86,0:22:40.51,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How many times do I have to tell you not to wander off?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.51,0:22:41.71,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.57,0:22:43.60,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.39,0:22:46.17,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Something to make me a young lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.90,0:22:49.77,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.77,0:22:51.14,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This is for much later!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.88,0:22:53.97,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Why?
